<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E55 Type is used for two kinds of controlled types: the expressive forms of works (prose, poetry, visual poetry, visual art, music), assigned to expressions via P2 has type, and, through the INTRO subclass INT11 Type of Interrelation, intertextual relation types such as hypertextuality, assigned via R19 has type. The properties that can be used with this class are skos:exactMatch and skos:inScheme."@en .
