<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An observable feature of a textual expression that may indicate the presence of a literary constraint. In DeSMòS it is treated as intratextual evidence: a textual trace supporting the identification of a constraint, without implying necessity or sufficiency by itself. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf and desmos:revealsConstraint."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costrizione formale"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F1 Work is used to represent the work as an abstract entity, distinct from the textual expressions through which it is realised. The property that can be used with this class is lrmoo:R3_is_realised_in."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS allinea un concetto DeSMòS a un concetto esterno semanticamente equivalente. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
