<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT16_Segment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT16 Segment è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il domain originale di R44 has wording; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS, dove R44 è applicata a INT21 Text Passage."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A constraint that operates primarily at the level of the signified. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:inScheme and skos:related."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> .
