<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P33 used specific technique: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed. The original property has domain crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure and range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R19i is type of"@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una risorsa correlata da cui deriva la risorsa corrente."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R17 created: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the compositional event that produced it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega un concetto di origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo) alle costrizioni letterarie che qualifica. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
