<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Literary constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Tipo di relazione intertestuale, nell'accezione genettiana, che designa qualsiasi rapporto di derivazione che collega un testo posteriore (l'ipertesto) ad un testo anteriore (l'ipotesto) sul quale esso si innesta in modo non commentativo; la derivazione può realizzarsi per trasformazione (come nella parodia) o per imitazione (come nel pastiche)."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R15i is fragment of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di involvesOperation: questa proprietà collega un'operazione procedurale alle costrizioni letterarie che la comportano. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F28 Creazione dell'espressione"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT1 Passage provides the general category for intro:INT21_TextPassage, used to represent textual passages involved in intertextual relations."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P67 refers to: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the declarations referring to it. The original property has domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vincola unità formale"@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E7 Activity è referenziata come domain originale di P14 carried out by e P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation ne è dichiarata sottoclasse diretta, abbreviando la catena ufficiale F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3)."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypotextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the entity referred to. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30_hasTextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un'espressione a un passaggio testuale selezionato al suo interno, quando la relazione intertestuale riguarda porzioni specifiche del testo. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di crm:E73_Information_Object e intro:INT1_Passage e come range intro:INT21_TextPassage. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range intro:INT21_TextPassage."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity è utilizzata come categoria di provenienza per gli oggetti linguistici di cui viene documentata l'attribuzione a un agente, in particolare le dichiarazioni relative alle costrizioni letterarie."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "data di emissione"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vedi anche"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "scope note"@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:N4e71ba07a50f40b88e34090fdc514e0a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nb01cd62f33c64772b3df29a7f361ba89 .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "label"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13_hasReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS identifica l'entità ipertestuale di una relazione intertestuale: l'intera espressione o, se la relazione è localizzabile, un passaggio specifico dell'ipertesto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E29 Design or Procedure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "informazioni sulla versione"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation is used to represent the compositional event that produces a textual expression and in which a literary constraint may be employed. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint and lrmoo:R17_created."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Costrizione che interviene prioritariamente sul significante. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower e skos:related."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
_:Nf6dec4bc2b78460f9d76dae088312a5e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> .
_:N69859e2d3dc746488197ccfd66599050 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:N4e71ba07a50f40b88e34090fdc514e0a .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Visual constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è origine di"@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Il documento legale che stabilisce i permessi di utilizzo della risorsa."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P129i è oggetto di"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isSemanticUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collega un'unità formale a un'unità formale di granularità testuale più ampia (es. la lettera rispetto a sillaba e parola), esclusivamente entro il FormalUnitScheme. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni visive, che intervengono sulla disposizione spaziale, grafica o tipografica del testo sulla pagina."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega un'espressione testuale all'evidenza testuale osservabile di una costrizione. La proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range desmos:TextualFeature."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che definisce la forma testuale dell'opera (prosa, poesia, forma visuale). Utilizzato per qualificare istanze di lrmoo:F2_Expression tramite crm:P2_has_type."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P14 carried out by: in DeSMòS, it relates an author to the expression creation events they carried out. The original property has domain crm:E39_Actor and range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E39_Actor and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E39 Actor è utilizzata per rappresentare autori, curatori e soggetti collettivi coinvolti nella creazione e nella documentazione delle espressioni testuali."@it .
_:N4e71ba07a50f40b88e34090fdc514e0a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R3i realizza"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N348636469c27458e8186f4ec3446c83a .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A textual description of the entity."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "created"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is formal unit constrained by"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E90 Symbolic Object è referenziata come range originale di R15 has fragment: le dichiarazioni peritestuali (E33 Linguistic Object) collegate a un'espressione mediante R15 sono oggetti simbolici attraverso E73 Information Object. È superclasse di E73 Information Object e, in INTRO, di INT1 Passage e INT16 Segment."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R4i è incarnata in"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage is used to represent an identifiable textual portion of an expression, particularly when documenting passages involved in an intertextual relation. The properties that can be used with this class are intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf and intro:R44_hasWording."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agent"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates a literary constraint to the concept qualifying its origin (tradition or brand-new invention). The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un'espressione alla dichiarazione peritestuale contenuta nella stessa pubblicazione, che ne è un frammento e documenta l'impiego di una costrizione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R15 has fragment"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "source"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costrizione letteraria"@it .
<http://schema.org/pagination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, schema:pagination is used to record the page or page range of a F3_Manifestation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il range originale di R12 has referred to entity e R13 has referring entity, e il domain delle loro inverse; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Semantic Constraint Scheme"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Formal Constraint Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "license"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33 ha usato la tecnica specifica"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P14 carried out by: in DeSMòS collega un autore agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione che ha realizzato. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E39_Actor e come range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E39_Actor e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E33 Linguistic Object is used to identify paratextual passages (epitextual or peritextual) in which the author or editor of the volume declares the use of a literary constraint. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P129_is_about, crm:P3_has_note, crm:P67_refers_to and prov:wasAttributedTo."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "preferred label"@en .
