<https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costrizione visiva"@it .
