<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed as a generative device; subproperty of crm:P33i_was_used_by. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P14 eseguito da"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E90 Symbolic Object is referenced as the original range of R15 has fragment: the peritextual statements (E33 Linguistic Object) linked to an expression through R15 are symbolic objects via E73 Information Object. It is the superclass of E73 Information Object and, in INTRO, of INT1 Passage and INT16 Segment."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS, it relates a source expression to the expressions derived from it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is operation involved in"@en .
