<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P148 has component: in DeSMòS, it relates a component to the complex expression or manifestation it belongs to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (between expressions) or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (between manifestations) and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation respectively."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of constrainsFormalUnit: relates a unit of the writing system to the formal constraints operating on it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:FormalConstraint."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R12i is referred to entity of"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS indica lo schema concettuale cui appartiene un concetto. La proprietà originale ha nessun domain dichiarato e come range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:N2de407b41b3a499f81c7e642bbe4c976 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "La data in cui la risorsa è stata modificata."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schema delle operazioni procedurali"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT16_Segment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT16 Segment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega una costrizione letteraria al concetto che ne qualifica l'origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of involvesOperation: this property relates a procedural operation to the literary constraints that involve it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33i was used by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/involvesOperation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates a literary constraint to the procedural operation its use involves. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range skos:Concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFeatureOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è caratteristica di"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R12 has referred to entity"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "nello schema"@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, dcterms:created è utilizzata per registrare la data associata all'evento di creazione di un'espressione."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E29 Design or Procedure provides the procedural category under which desmos:LiteraryConstraint is modelled, as a procedure applied during the creation of an expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it aligns a DeSMòS concept with a semantically equivalent external concept. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
_:Nc298ad92f22941b49121a64f97e0aa04 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una stringa che identifica la versione di questa ontologia."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, R44 has wording è utilizzata per registrare come stringa la formulazione testuale esatta di un passaggio identificato mediante INT21 Text Passage."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è l'operazione coinvolta in"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/involvesOperation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come procedura compositiva. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E7_Activity e come range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
