<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una descrizione della risorsa."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
_:Nae0fbf48ebe24e97945a4eb8709fd7e0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schema delle costrizioni formali"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un concetto a un concetto più generale entro gli schemi controllati dell'ontologia. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Procedural Operation Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di isRevealedBy: questa proprietà collega un'evidenza testuale alla costrizione letteraria che rende identificabile. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:TextualFeature e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione fonte alle espressioni che ne derivano. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isSemanticUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of constrainsSemanticUnit: relates a unit of the content plane to the semantic constraints that determine it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:SemanticConstraint."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P3_has_note> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object è la superclasse comune delle entità non materiali del modello: attraverso E89 Propositional Object ed E90 Symbolic Object comprende gli oggetti informativi (opere, espressioni, oggetti linguistici, passaggi); è inoltre superclasse diretta di E55 Type, desmos:TextualFeature e intro:INT3_Interrelation (le relazioni intertestuali reificate), nonché di intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext, referenziate solo nei range originali di R12 e R13."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concept scheme defining the discrete units of the writing system (e.g., letter, syllable, word) on which a formal constraint operates. Expected as the range value of desmos:constrainsFormalUnit."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P148i is component of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT31 Intertextual Relation è utilizzata per rappresentare come entità autonoma una relazione intertestuale tra testi o loro passaggi, specificandone le entità coinvolte e la tipologia. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono intro:R12_hasReferredToEntity, intro:R13_hasReferringEntity e intro:R19_hasType."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "exact match"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che definisce la forma artistica di espressioni non linguistiche (arte visuale, musica). Utilizzato per qualificare istanze di lrmoo:F2_Expression tramite crm:P2_has_type, in complemento a desmos:LiteraryFormScheme nei casi in cui l'espressione non sia un testo."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A description of the resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schema delle costrizioni visive"@it .
_:Nf8b4490a135f40c89670df7ad1999390 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N75b54eeabe2341e8babc365b545afd7e .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega uno schema concettuale ai concetti che ne costituiscono i punti di accesso gerarchici principali. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "corrispondenza vicina"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "DeSMòS (Descriptive Semantic Model for Structured Texts)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ipertestualità"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it indicates the concept scheme to which a concept belongs. The original property has no declared domain and range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega una manifestazione editoriale o digitale all'espressione che incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un'entità responsabile della creazione della risorsa."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A name given to the resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://schema.org/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P2 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di forma letteraria o artistica alle espressioni che classifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E55_Type e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E55_Type e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A note about the past use of the concept."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, dcterms:issued è utilizzata per registrare la data di pubblicazione o emissione di una manifestazione."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a formal unit to a formal unit of finer textual granularity (e.g., a word with respect to a syllable or a letter), exclusively within the FormalUnitScheme. The property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa proprietà collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come dispositivo generativo; sottoproprietà di crm:P33_used_specific_technique. La proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P3_has_note> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, P3 has note è utilizzata per associare a un oggetto linguistico o a una caratteristica testuale una descrizione testuale aggiuntiva espressa come letterale."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E90 Oggetto Simbolico"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
