_:N6393be91e22943cc81ba80ed06556ea5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DeSMòS"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Used as the object of intro:R19_hasType to qualify instances of intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation as Genettian hypertextual relations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipertestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità referente. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
