<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipotestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità a cui si fa riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R19 ha tipo"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT1 Passage fornisce la categoria generale per intro:INT21_TextPassage, utilizzata per rappresentare i passaggi testuali coinvolti nelle relazioni intertestuali."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Type of intertextual relation, in the Genettian sense, designating any relationship of derivation linking a later text (the hypertext) to an earlier one (the hypotext) upon which it is grafted in a manner that is not that of commentary; the derivation may proceed by transformation (as in parody) or by imitation (as in pastiche)."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A related resource that is a version, edition, or adaptation of the described resource."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P3_has_note> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha nota"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30_hasTextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un nome dato alla risorsa."@it .
