<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E7 Attività"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression to the peritextual declaration contained in the same publication, which is a fragment of it and documents the use of a constraint. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@en .
_:N89804f5ffb624956b59b82abfba6949a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A related resource from which the described resource is derived."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
