<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "è unità formale vincolata da"@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT6 Architext is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> .
