<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT1 Passaggio"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30_hasTextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression to a textual passage selected within it, when an intertextual relation concerns specific portions of the text. The original property has domain the union of crm:E73_Information_Object and intro:INT1_Passage and range intro:INT21_TextPassage. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range intro:INT21_TextPassage."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS indica che una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) ha come argomento una costrizione letteraria. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, prov:Agent è utilizzata per rappresentare gli agenti ai quali vengono attribuite entità o dichiarazioni, inclusi autori, curatori, soggetti collettivi e, ove pertinente, sistemi software."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R19 has type"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFeatureOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Versione 1.2.0"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schema delle costrizioni semantiche"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of skos:hasTopConcept: in DeSMòS, it relates a concept to the scheme of which it is a main hierarchical entry point. The original property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13_hasReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R13 has referring entity"@en .
