_:N00e99d6a9d8c401fb88ecec8914d471e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it attributes a declaration (linguistic object) about a constraint to the agent responsible for it. The original property has domain prov:Entity and range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range crm:E39_Actor (also prov:Agent)."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
