<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS qualifica una relazione intertestuale con un tipo controllato (es. ipertestualità). La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione assunta come fonte alle espressioni che ne presentano tratti senza derivarne il contenuto. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "DeSMòS adopts an \"alignment-by-reference\" pattern to keep the ontology lightweight and reasoner-friendly."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N519b097bffb94882b572110f47d6b1ce .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R19 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a relation type to the intertextual relations it qualifies. The original property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concept scheme defining the textual form of the work (prose, poetry, visual form). Used to qualify lrmoo:F2_Expression instances via crm:P2_has_type."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E7 Activity is referenced as the original domain of P14 carried out by and P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation is declared as its direct subclass, abbreviating the official chain F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "was attributed to"@en .
