_:N75b54eeabe2341e8babc365b545afd7e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Semantic Unit Scheme"@en .
