<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the literary constraint employed as a compositional procedure. The original property has domain crm:E7_Activity and range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> .
