<https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Concept scheme defining the artistic form of non-linguistic expressions (visual art, music). Used to qualify lrmoo:F2_Expression instances via crm:P2_has_type, complementing desmos:LiteraryFormScheme where the source expression is not a text."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un nome leggibile per l'entità."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rivela costrizione"@it .
<http://schema.org/pagination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pagination"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation è utilizzata per rappresentare l'evento compositivo che produce un'espressione testuale e nel quale può essere impiegata una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint e lrmoo:R17_created."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P130i caratteristiche si ritrovano anche in"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A bibliographic reference for the resource."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories is used to represent relation types derived from theories of intertextuality, including hypertextuality in Gérard Genette's classification."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E55 Type"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it documents a looser link between expressions than R76 is derivative of: the expression shows features of a source (lexical, onomastic, phraseological, thematic, narrative or, for non-textual sources, of tempo and pacing) without deriving its content or establishing an INTRO intertextual relation. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is constraint used in"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di skos:hasTopConcept: in DeSMòS collega un concetto allo schema di cui è punto di accesso gerarchico principale. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS esprime associazioni semantiche non gerarchiche tra concetti dei vocabolari controllati. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This property relates a semantic constraint to the semantic unit on which it operates (e.g., character, space, or time). The property has domain desmos:SemanticConstraint and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E90 Symbolic Object"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schema delle forme letterarie"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, R44 has wording is used to record as a string the exact textual wording of a passage identified through INT21 Text Passage."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che definisce le unità discrete del sistema di scrittura (ad esempio lettera, sillaba, parola) su cui opera una costrizione di tipo formale. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constrainsFormalUnit."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, la classe viene utilizzata per definire le singole costrizioni letterarie e le categorie analitiche all'interno di un sistema di conoscenza organizzato. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:coarserThan, desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:finerThan, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:exactMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower e skos:related."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
