<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
_:Naea0bf1f9f814ec38fc0284538c6c0be <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13_hasReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it identifies the hypertextual entity of an intertextual relation: the whole expression or, when the relation can be localised, a specific passage of the hypertext. The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha granularità più ampia di"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P2i è tipo di"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
