<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isSemanticUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is semantic unit constrained by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/desmos/v1.2.0> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS documenta un legame tra espressioni più blando di R76 is derivative of: l'espressione presenta tratti di una fonte (lessicali, onomastici, fraseologici, tematici, narrativi o, per fonti non testuali, di andamento) senza derivarne il contenuto né instaurare una relazione intertestuale INTRO. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constraint origin"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it aligns a DeSMòS concept with a semantically close but non-equivalent external concept. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An entity responsible for making the resource."@en .
