<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F3 Manifestation is used to represent the published or digital manifestation embodying an expression and carrying information about its publication and textual location. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P148_has_component, crm:P148i_is_component_of, dcterms:issued, lrmoo:R4_embodies and schema:pagination."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "used constraint"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R3 is realised in"@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it states that a declaration (linguistic object) has a literary constraint as its subject. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A statement of the meaning of the concept."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object is the common superclass of the non-material entities in the model: through E89 Propositional Object and E90 Symbolic Object it subsumes information objects (works, expressions, linguistic objects, passages); it is also the direct superclass of E55 Type, desmos:TextualFeature and intro:INT3_Interrelation (the reified intertextual relations), as well as of intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext, which are referenced only in the original ranges of R12 and R13."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67_refers_to> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is revealed by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Artistic Form Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Collega un'unità formale a un'unità formale di granularità testuale più fine (es. la parola rispetto a sillaba e lettera), esclusivamente entro il FormalUnitScheme. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT3 Interrelation provides the general category for the reified representation of relations between entities, specialised through INT31 Intertextual Relation for the intertextual relations considered in the model."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R3 è realizzato in"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha granularità più fine di"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypertextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the referring entity. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P130i features are also found on"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Formal Unit Scheme"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R19 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di relazione alle relazioni intertestuali che qualifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Questa classe comprende entità che esistono come insiemi di caratteristiche o proprietà, piuttosto che come oggetti fisici. In DeSMòS, rappresenta le entità astratte come le opere e, attraverso E73 Information Object, le espressioni, le dichiarazioni e le costrizioni letterarie. Le relazioni intertestuali (intro:INT3_Interrelation) non ne fanno parte, essendo sottoclasse diretta di E28 Conceptual Object."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
_:N519b097bffb94882b572110f47d6b1ce <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:Nef3fd721b04b46c4bb6dc40c1a758c9e .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class comprises entities that exist as sets of characteristics or properties rather than as physical objects. In DeSMòS, it represents abstract entities such as works and, through E73 Information Object, expressions, declarations and literary constraints. Intertextual relations (intro:INT3_Interrelation) are not included, being a direct subclass of E28 Conceptual Object."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "see also"@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, dcterms:created is used to record the date associated with an expression creation event."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E55 Tipo"@it .
_:Nf25af678661840df9a81198ad16cb724 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nc298ad92f22941b49121a64f97e0aa04 .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
