<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di skos:broader: in DeSMòS collega un concetto a un concetto più specifico entro gli schemi controllati dell'ontologia. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R17i was created by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Visual Constraint Scheme"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P67 refers to: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale alle dichiarazioni che vi fanno riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, skos:ConceptScheme is used to organise literary constraints and the analytical categories used to describe them into controlled vocabularies. The property that can be used with this class is skos:hasTopConcept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
_:N75b54eeabe2341e8babc365b545afd7e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N68e9e0231c5f411b8c29f0290c98a2a2 .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "licenza"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E33 Linguistic Object"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di R4 embodies: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione alla manifestazione editoriale o digitale che la incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation."@it .
_:N701be260e2f64ff1b1137da86a692d04 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E1 CRM Entity is the root of the CIDOC CRM hierarchy and is referenced as the original domain or range of P2 has type, P3 has note, P67 refers to and P129 is about. E7 Activity, E39 Actor and E70 Thing are declared as its direct subclasses, abbreviating the official chains through E5 Event and E77 Persistent Item."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Constraint that intervenes on the visual or typographic arrangement of the text, where the spatial layout of letters/words on the page is itself part of the rule. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme and skos:related."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Caratteristica osservabile di un'espressione testuale che può indicare la presenza di una costrizione letteraria. In DeSMòS è intesa come evidenza intratestuale: una traccia testuale che supporta l’identificazione della costrizione, senza implicare di per sé sufficienza o necessità. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf e desmos:revealsConstraint."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "commento"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT15 Intertestualità nelle teorie dell'intertestualità"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E1 CRM Entity è la radice della gerarchia di CIDOC CRM ed è referenziata come domain o range originale di P2 has type, P3 has note, P67 refers to e P129 is about. E7 Activity, E39 Actor ed E70 Thing ne sono dichiarate sottoclassi dirette, abbreviando le catene ufficiali che passano per E5 Event ed E77 Persistent Item."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT3 Interrelation fornisce la categoria generale per la rappresentazione reificata delle relazioni tra entità, specializzata attraverso INT31 Intertextual Relation per le relazioni intertestuali considerate nel modello."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E39 Attore"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS identifica l'entità ipotestuale di una relazione intertestuale: l'intera espressione o, se la relazione è localizzabile, un passaggio specifico dell'ipotesto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage."@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of skos:broader: in DeSMòS, it relates a concept to a more specific concept within the ontology's controlled schemes. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> .
