<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R76 è derivato di"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni semantiche, che intervengono prioritariamente sul significato del testo."@it .
