<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT21 Text Passage"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P129 is about: in DeSMòS collega una costrizione letteraria alle dichiarazioni che la hanno come argomento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F3 Manifestazione"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R76i ha derivato"@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage è utilizzata per rappresentare una porzione testuale identificabile di un'espressione, in particolare quando è necessario documentare i passaggi coinvolti in una relazione intertestuale. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf e intro:R44_hasWording."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS articola espressioni e manifestazioni complesse nelle rispettive componenti. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (tra espressioni) o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (tra manifestazioni) e come range rispettivamente lrmoo:F2_Expression o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inversa di P148 has component: in DeSMòS collega una componente all'espressione o manifestazione complessa di cui fa parte. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (tra espressioni) o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (tra manifestazioni) e come range rispettivamente lrmoo:F2_Expression o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of R30 has text passage: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual passage to the expression from which it is taken. The original property has domain intro:INT21_TextPassage and range the union of crm:E73_Information_Object and intro:INT1_Passage. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT21_TextPassage and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che distingue le costrizioni riprese dalla tradizione da quelle introdotte ex novo in uno specifico contesto compositivo. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constraintOrigin."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity is used as a provenance category for linguistic objects whose attribution to an agent is documented, particularly declarations concerning literary constraints."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione all'espressione testuale che produce. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ha versione"@it .
