<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E29 Progetto o Procedura"@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
