<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the textual expression it produces. The original property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it expresses non-hierarchical associations between concepts of the controlled vocabularies. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Una nota sull'uso passato del concetto."@it .
_:Ndb8f2bf091674a32af4ad5b875fde088 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N00e99d6a9d8c401fb88ecec8914d471e .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Schema concettuale che definisce le unità discrete del piano del contenuto (personaggio, spazio, tempo) determinate da una costrizione di tipo semantico. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates a published or digital manifestation to the expression it embodies. The original property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
_:Nc45a6abe444a458a8758c19073577254 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT1 Passage"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> "1.2.0" .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS, it relates an expression used as a source to the expressions showing its features without deriving its content. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it decomposes complex expressions and manifestations into their components. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (between expressions) or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (between manifestations) and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation respectively."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "corrispondenza esatta"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P2 has type"@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indica una risorsa esterna che può fornire informazioni supplementari sulla risorsa descritta."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P148i è componente di"@it .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates a concept to a more general concept within the ontology's controlled schemes. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, E70 Thing è referenziata come domain e range originali di P130 shows features of. E28 Conceptual Object ne è dichiarata sottoclasse diretta, abbreviando la catena ufficiale E28 Conceptual Object ⊑ E71 Human-Made Thing ⊑ E70 Thing (CIDOC CRM 7.1.3)."@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "date issued"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "E70 Thing"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "origine della costrizione"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constrains semantic unit"@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F2 Expression è utilizzata per rappresentare la realizzazione testuale di un'opera, sulla quale vengono documentate le costrizioni letterarie e le relazioni con altri testi. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in e lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:N69859e2d3dc746488197ccfd66599050 .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT11 Type of Interrelation è utilizzata come categoria generale per i tipi che qualificano le relazioni intertestuali rappresentate attraverso INTRO."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
