<https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "DeSMòS adotta un pattern di \"allineamento per riferimento\" per mantenere l'ontologia leggera e compatibile con i reasoner."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67_refers_to> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates a declaration (linguistic object) to the textual expression it refers to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> .
