<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT31 Intertextual Relation is used to represent an intertextual relation between texts or their passages as an independent entity, specifying the entities involved and the relation type. The properties that can be used with this class are intro:R12_hasReferredToEntity, intro:R13_hasReferringEntity and intro:R19_hasType."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P148 ha componente"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "INT3 Interrelazione"@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F2 Expression is used to represent the textual realisation of a work, on which literary constraints and relations to other texts are documented. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in and lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A constraint that operates primarily at the level of the signifier. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower and skos:related."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/isFeatureOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R44 ha formulazione"@it .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The date on which the resource was modified."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "R4 embodies"@en .
