<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates a work to the textual expression that realises it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F1_Work and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F1_Work and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
